  "label": "Meme Format",
  "description": "The meme format of using an image of animals (often primates) with a humorous or ironic caption to imply human-like confusion or frustration is a common internet trope. This format relies on the audience understanding that animals are being used as stand-ins for humans in a comedic or satirical context, which requires knowledge of internet meme culture.",
